# Devastating Onslaught's target is "artifact or creature YOU control": Bot2's Mox Pearl is refused (the cast naming it is
# not offered) while Bot1's own Mox Jet, the positive control, is. X=0 costs only {R}: no tokens are created (CR 107.3b, "create
# X tokens" of zero), nothing is left to sacrifice, and the spell goes to the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Devastating Onslaught
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Plains x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Devastating Onslaught.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl)
Bot1.Hand.Devastating Onslaught.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet; X: 0)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.End]
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Ruby; Mox Jet
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 2
Bot2.Battlefield = Mox Pearl
Bot1.Graveyard = Devastating Onslaught
Stack.Count = 0
